---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions - Otaku Blitz">
  <main class="flex-grow">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--color-primary)]/15 to-[var(--color-secondary)]/15 py-14 md:py-20">
      <div class="section-container max-w-4xl text-center">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-accent-lavender)]">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="gradient-text text-4xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base">Last updated: September 20, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
      <div class="section-container max-w-4xl">
        <article class="card space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Using Otaku Blitz</h2>
            <p>Otaku Blitz is provided for personal, non-commercial entertainment. By using the site, you agree to use it respectfully and not to disrupt, damage, or attempt to gain unauthorized access to the site, its services, or its leaderboards.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Player names and leaderboard entries</h2>
            <p>Please choose an appropriate nickname. We may remove or restrict leaderboard entries that are offensive, misleading, abusive, or created through automated or unfair means.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Content and intellectual property</h2>
            <p>Otaku Blitz and its original site content are provided for gameplay and informational use. Anime titles, characters, and related names belong to their respective owners. Do not reproduce or redistribute site content without permission where permission is required.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Availability and changes</h2>
            <p>We may change, pause, or discontinue features, questions, scores, or leaderboard functionality at any time. The site is provided as available, without a guarantee that every feature will always be uninterrupted or error-free.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Questions</h2>
            <p>If you have questions about these terms, please <a class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent-lavender)] hover:underline" href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
